><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943030/extras/91a3e9442629de72ef8a3d72f5581ee8.mp4?t=1765414807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​​🔥 Endless Trials: The Ultimate Gamble​​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, monsters evolve deadlier abilities—can your build keep up? Only true gamblers dare challenge ​<strong>​&quot;Hell Mode&quot;​</strong>​—where failure means permadeath, but victory… crowns you a legend of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943030/extras/ae5fb0e0028a6e366efca34591428b06.poster.avif?t=1765414807\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943030/extras/ae5fb0e0028a6e366efca34591428b06.webm?t=1765414807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943030/extras/ae5fb0e0028a6e366efca34591428b06.mp4?t=1765414807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
